        "content": "<p>You might be thinking of <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=LawfulXor#doc\">docs#LawfulXor</a>, but this is for <code>^^^</code> not <code>^^</code></p>",
